cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, its methods, data or results, please cite it as below."
title: "Voynich AI Cryptolinguist: a pre-registered, known-answer-validated programme for deciphering the Voynich Manuscript"
abstract: >-
  An open research toolkit and ledger for testing decipherment hypotheses about the Voynich Manuscript
  (Beinecke MS 408). Every attack is first validated on synthetic texts with known answers and meaningless
  controls, every test is pre-registered and hash-locked, and every result, including null results, is published.
type: software
authors:
